primary = [root/'AGENTS.md', root/'HANDOFF.md', root/'START_HERE.md',
           root/'resume-2026-09-28-001/SESSION.md', base/'RESOURCE_COORDINATION.md']
old = {path:path.read_bytes() for path in primary}
header = f'''**MAJOR STEP024 - FRESH METADATA002 SOURCE BINDINGS STATIC PASS; GG5 REVIEW UTILITY001 REFUSED; CONSUMER004 TYPE-EQUALITY LIMIT AND BOUNDED DESIGN UNDER AUDIT.**
Recorded {stamp}. Owner ends2026-10-02T22:36:15Z. Read [checkpoint024](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_024.md), HANDOFF, START_HERE and newest SESSION.
Metadata2 sourceaf658/Bound9 212f/actualPy d8f/PSsource11384 peerdd229 fourexact2literalrev parse0: SOURCEONLY. ActualAUTH17/capture/whole/ACK22/bound22/PS3/late14/unit absent. Oldmetadata1SPENTexpirednoReplayTTL. GG5fastUtility001peer9be07REFUSEDwronglauncherfilename(noBOUND), mainUNRUN; distinct002authoringdifferentpeerrequired. Consumer0048a5b810+post811/764beforepairs/19methods14oldAST+5families680newplannedUNRUN/inertCodeTypeonly/noexec. Mapping kind-in equality custommetaclass gap authorflagged/differentbranchorderauditpending/no nominalclosure/noindependentapproval; preserve006/004. PubNativeDesign001123d/4fbe59payload+manifest60/50pairs/new11literal17528 naive277874>262142 by15732/typed21724advisorydigestb292 unaccepted/5731growthfixed/compiledmiddleInternalnot44or17newfields/differentdesignpeerpending/noimplementation. All58Raw/24Metadata/14Guard/111Native remainUNRUN. Actualfastreviewsreadybeforecapture/context600 boundlate90 reserve450+60 resources60throughspawn/docfixedinterval. Canonical-Pro3HELD/no deliveredsoleACKleasequiet/no inferredownerreply/no unrelatedstop/science-twins-epoch-history-spent-caps-reserves/pipedGO/noNonInteractive/no-public-no-push-no-replay/monitorrestorecloseout. Earlierbytes exacthistory.

'''.encode()
handoff = re.sub(r'\]\(([^)]+)\)', lambda match:'](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/'+match.group(1)+')',
                  body.replace('# Major step024 - fresh metadata source bindings reviewed; review utility refused; consumer identity correction under audit',
                               '# Current pro2 handoff - major step024')).encode()
start = b'''# Start here

Read [HANDOFF](HANDOFF.md), [checkpoint024](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_024.md) and newest [SESSION](resume-2026-09-28-001/SESSION.md).

