entry = f'''\n\n## {stamp} - ROOT MAJOR024: source bindings reviewed; fast review refused; nominal identity and bounded design under audit

[Checkpoint024](../resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_024.md). Docs23peer ef8a frozenPASS/72inputs exactAGENTS190001suffix/SESSION316943prefix/RESOURCE17894prefix. Metadata2 sourceaf658/actualPy d8f/bound4bae peer9-role212f/PSsource11384 differentdd229 four2literalreversalsparse0/sourceonly. RootstagePython10:54:55.803670/PS11:00:24.378520 createoncemetadata sourcecopies, nohelperentry. ActualAUTH/capture/whole/ACK/bound/late/unit absent. GG5reviewutility001peer9be07REFUSEDwrongfilename noBOUND25inputs exact/mainUNRUN/distinct2authoringdifferentpeerbeforemain. Consumer0048a5b810+post811/764beforepairs/19methods14oldAST+5families680NEWplannedUNRUN/inertRaw4+6ASTCodeTypeonly/noexec/006kind-in custommetaclassequality authorflagged/noindependentapproval/differentearlybranchorderauditpending/freshchoicecorrectionrequired. PubNativeDesign001123d/4fbe59payload+manifest60/50pairs/naive17528literals common196114Base64261488+16384+2=277874>262142by15732/typed21724b292ADVISORY/unaccepted/5731growthfixed/compiledmiddleinternalnotnew44or17fields/differentdesignpeerpending/noimplementation. OldMetadata1spentexpired/Guard14Raw58Metadata24Native111 allUNRUN/NativeM02inheritedstaticprediction. Fastreviewspreparedbeforefreshcapture/context600boundlate90reserve450+60/resource60throughspawn/docfixedproofinterval. CanonicalPro3HELD/no deliveredsoleACKleasequiet/ownerquestionpending/no inferredreply/no unrelatedstop/science-twins-epoch-history-spent-caps-reserves/pipedGO/noNonInteractive/no-public-no-push-no-replay/monitorrestorecloseout. Root024differentdocspeerahead.
