resource_entry = f'''\n\n### {stamp} - major024: fresh source bindings and actual freshness custody

[Checkpoint024](30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_024.md). Source-only metadata2af658/212f/dd229 accepted; actualAuth/capture/whole/ACK/units remainunrun. FastGG5utility1refused9be for wronglauncherfilename; distinct2/differentpeerbeforemain. Reviewcommandsreadybeforetimer/context600 boundlateage90 reserve450+60 resourceage60 THROUGHdriverspawn/docfixedproofinterval. Spentmetadata1expiredcannotretimestamp/replay. PubNativeDesignnaive277874>262142/unaccepted21724commitment/fixed5731growth/16paths8OScommandsJobNone/noimplementation. Consumer4equality-typegap notnominalclosure/allcurrenttestsUNRUN. CanonicalPro3HELD/no deliveredsoleACKleasequiet/no unrelatedstop/monitorrestorecloseout.
